# Claude Code's first run, driven to the point where a turn is in flight.
#
# Nothing is typed that leaves the program: the capture ends while the request
# is still unanswered, so the last frame holds the spinner rather than the
# screen Claude restores on exit. The endpoint (see record.sh) accepts the
# connection and never answers, which is what keeps the spinner up.
4000 \r
4000 \r
3000 \x1b[B
1000 \r
2000
